IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-scope`
IMPORT `P2-section-2-gate`
IMPORT `P2-art-10`

-- Tests of P2-art-10.l4. Every expected value is written by hand from the text (the quoted line above each function), never from the code's output.
-- Argument order of a gated function: the date asked, the AI system, the harmonisation facts, then the facts of the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`Art 10 test the Annex III system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 10 test the Annex I system` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 10 test the system placed earlier` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 10 test the system placed earlier and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE
`Art 10 test the system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE
`Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Art 10 test Section B products facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS TRUE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS FALSE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE
`Art 10 test Section A equivalent facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS TRUE
`Art 10 test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` MEANS `Arts 8 to 15 harmonisation facts` WITH
    `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS FALSE
    `Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I lays down requirements or obligations providing an equivalent or higher level of protection of health, safety or fundamental rights as the requirement or obligation concerned` IS TRUE
    `such limitation does not reduce the overall level of protection provided for by this Regulation` IS FALSE


§ `Article 10(1): data sets that meet the quality criteria`

-- Art 10(1) as enacted the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as enacted the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 of this Article
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as enacted the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in paragraph 5 of this Article
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as enacted the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- outside the scope of the text: the high-risk AI system makes use of techniques involving the training of AI models with data is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as enacted the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- outside the scope of the text: training, validation and testing data sets are used is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as enacted the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Art 10(1) as amended the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as amended the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 of this Article
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as amended the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the data sets used meet the quality criteria referred to in Article 4a(1)
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as amended the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- outside the scope of the text: the high-risk AI system makes use of techniques involving the training of AI models with data is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as amended the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- outside the scope of the text: training, validation and testing data sets are used is not the case
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) as amended the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 1 8 2028) `Art 10 test the Annex I system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 10 test the Annex I system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 10 test the system placed earlier` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 10 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 10 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(2): an Article 6(1) system related to Section B products meets only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 10 test the Annex I system` `Art 10 test Section B products facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 2(2) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system related to Section B products is not cut off
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test Section B products facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13): the application of Articles 9 to 15 may be limited where Section A legislation gives equivalent protection and the overall level is not reduced
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 10 test the Annex I system` `Art 10 test Section A equivalent facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(13)(b) fails (the limitation would reduce the overall level of protection): the requirement applies in full
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 10 test the Annex I system` `Art 10 test Section A equivalent but overall protection reduced facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 2(13) reaches only the Article 6(1) route: an Annex III system is not limited
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test Section A equivalent facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- as amended, every criterion met
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the criteria of paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 not met
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the criteria referred to in Article 4a(1) not met (the text as amended)
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the criteria of paragraph 5 not met: the text as amended does not read paragraph 5, which the Omnibus deleted
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the system does not make use of techniques involving the training of AI models with data
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- no such data sets are used: "whenever such data sets are used"
#ASSERT `Art 10(1) the high-risk AI system is developed on the basis of data sets that meet the quality criteria` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING


§ `Article 10(2): data governance and management practices`

-- Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 1 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day after
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 3 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex I system (Art 113(c)(ii)): not applicable
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 1 8 2028) `Art 10 test the Annex I system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the day Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 8 2028) `Art 10 test the Annex I system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the first day of the text as amended: Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not yet apply
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application and not significantly changed, so saved
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 10 test the system placed earlier` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): the same system after a significant change in its design is covered
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 10 test the system placed earlier and changed` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a high-risk AI system: no date of application, not covered
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 10 test the system that is not high-risk` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- every element of the text is met
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not met: the training, validation and testing data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose of the high-risk AI system
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the practices concern the relevant design choices
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the practices concern data collection processes and the origin of data, and in the case of personal data, the original purpose of the data collection
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the practices concern relevant data-preparation processing operations, such as annotation, labelling, cleaning, updating, enrichment and aggregation
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the practices concern the formulation of assumptions, in particular with respect to the information that the data are supposed to measure and represent
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the practices concern an assessment of the availability, quantity and suitability of the data sets that are needed
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the practices concern examination in view of possible biases that are likely to affect the health and safety of persons, have a negative impact on fundamental rights or lead to discrimination prohibited under Union law, especially where data outputs influence inputs for future operations
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the practices concern appropriate measures to detect, prevent and mitigate possible biases identified according to point (f)
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the practices concern the identification of relevant data gaps or shortcomings that prevent compliance with this Regulation, and how those gaps and shortcomings can be addressed
#ASSERT `Art 10(2) the data sets are subject to data governance and management practices appropriate for the intended purpose, which concern the following` (Date 2 12 2027) `Art 10 test the Annex III system` `Art 10 test no harmonisation facts` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


